cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the paper and the software."

title: "EAGF: Ethical AI Governance Framework for Cybersecurity in Renewable Energy IoT Systems"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2025-01-01
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/your-org/eagf
url: https://github.com/your-org/eagf

abstract: >
  EAGF is the first framework to formally operationalise all four EU AI Act
  governance pillars — transparency, fairness, privacy, and accountability —
  within a single adversarial-aware AI lifecycle for cybersecurity applications,
  with deep integration into 5G-connected Renewable Energy IoT infrastructure.

